    "body": "@isiahmeadows thanks for clarifying, then maybe the proposal text should be updated ... but to be sure we're on the same page:\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<ul id=\"list\">\r\n  <li>first task</li>\r\n  <!-- some comment -->\r\n</ul>\r\n```\r\n\r\nAssuming a new item such as:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst task = document.createElement('li');\r\ntask.textContent = 'last task';\r\n```\r\n\r\n### list.insertAfter(task, null)\r\n\r\nwould produce:\r\n```html\r\n<ul id=\"list\">\r\n  <li>first task</li>\r\n  <!-- some comment -->\r\n  <li>last task</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n```\r\n\r\nwhile ...\r\n\r\n### list.insertAfter(task, list.lastElementChild)\r\n\r\nwould produce:\r\n```html\r\n<ul id=\"list\">\r\n  <li>first task</li>\r\n  <li>last task</li>\r\n  <!-- some comment -->\r\n</ul>\r\n```\r\n\r\ndid I get it right?",
