    "body": "@WebReflection That is correct. The idea is that you're inserting a node, but specifically after *nothing*. And if nothing's supposed to be before it, then you're essentially prepending it. And so yes, that's the intent.\r\n\r\n- `elem.insertAfter(node, null)` &rarr; `elem.prepend(node)`\r\n- `elem.insertAfter(node, refNode)` &rarr; `refNode.after(node)`\r\n- `elem.insertAfter(node, elem.lastChild)` &rarr; `elem.append(node)`",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
